  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Secure, Affordable, and Sustainable Energy for Sri Lanka</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen transmission infrastructure and institutional capacity for better renewable energy integration.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed Project is structured around two main components. Component 1 will focus on investments needs for system stability and grid integration of the RE sub-projects. Component 2 will help to strengthen CEB&apos;s institutional capacity and to advance reforms.</narrative>
  </description>
